    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e8ab039861b697031c130b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天，看过传单的爱丽速子表示她对活动\n有兴趣，还说会再带一个人来参加演唱会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a505814134cd6433064e03ed9c05d4f18550f816c1634380ed0d0f1395bcc187",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
