    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958a12de380fbea620011b64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一天的小型演唱会结束后，无声铃鹿想知道\n演唱会对自己比赛表现的影响，\n而向粉丝听取意见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "165935da93263bc4339e6c31e274d1f3bda0be370068f21a6a6e8381073411cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003404.json",
      "json_path": [
