    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a246fde5d6796edaedbffa16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "友谊赛后的胜者舞台上，\n无声铃鹿在舞台上听见\n来自粉丝们的“欢迎回来”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c5599d4cfafcbf4b6f360927f160d9bedf0200fd546463ab0326244774b9f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae9a219eda1197704565857d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55dcb2dd61433fd36fb39a87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一瞬间，\n有股“想回到这里”的心情涌上来。\n她将这份心情直率地传达给粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c53098f28b50af29ca45423fde96ce0febcedf1dcbcda16f4b66519cea95d068",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e84c4daeb397ac553a88b28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4592f8dac3f1cfada7fbd7f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过了几天，大家在准备Grand Live时，\n有几名赛马娘表示有兴趣。\n但是，同时也有赛马娘大声反对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "383ce2a92319be094bb6d0c35ba98003d6a4e544e56df968f7654c52c9e0c887",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c32ea84f2c8f0647e7ab5689",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3775d1b67c3e592098f0eafd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谁都可以唱歌的演唱会就像是在\n否定付出的努力，逃避赢不了的现实──\n这一席话带来了沉重的静默。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7de360acac7fff0900ed126fcec19439f4c62c486b7c2bd8afdcc6ec01ec9add",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a39cc6c74547534da6e8dfc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你“唱得出来”吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f16d79a36a19214f895aa4b625340e8297a6fe487bc2820981537d59409fe7a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de2f6b6d13c5280654cc8189",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“逃避无法获胜的现实”\n这番话震惊了所有人，\n轻柔致意的意志也受到打击。",
      "source_fingerprint": "719f78d678c98398fb58470102676689f33660d8b810412e88a973552cfae53d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb5beac3982e94bd7b98dcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我因为担心而去找她，然后听她诉说，\n她或许只是想消除过去赢不了竞赛，\n无法在演唱会上唱歌的后悔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c2036dd7746b6468e7384c23eca01dfc45c007e6420d0e78074294bf3e66a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8d6d70bea3f2edbec4c130",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，轻柔致意前来道歉，\n并表示Grand Live这个计划是错的。\n但美浦波旁反问：那真的是错的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41e9bff6376e2a4e00fd87ed37e27a94c8e51c3b76dd9722ef772008d4907372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:244b9163ea42fd9996da49f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说，如果多了能传达心意的地方，她就想参加。\n醒目飞鹰也主张，Grand Live有令人兴奋的要素。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bf9de72804de26713f0dcfae68aa19d2d7d992ed719f4d6c6aa0321325ad57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b2ecdeef75ff105b0d0fa4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Grand Live或许还存在尚未被发现的可能性。\n我们就继续准备，并且思考它的可能性吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a8b861d97a7ebdc8c1c237a2602a376a22f36fe4c524b7a935c02c972d8834c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d2737f2d66a17224a1e305b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挥别后悔",
      "source_fingerprint": "74367df58f9f9f82f7a73a07010157cd628b1e4e6f39960d750e89111457dbe2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3daf09c79ab15085366f5737",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
