    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89175f361a389813c80d12e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在讨论过程中，我们注意到演唱会并非只是\n单方面地表达感谢的场所。\n演唱会上除了赛马娘外，也有她们的粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e12758f7c533fc51359244580d131b35b5815a3a221adff6992a7bc3d29c3e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
