    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4529620e273fb4f431b508f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429d2dc2473d614390635e10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欣赏前辈的演唱会，是轻柔致意曾经的愿望。\n以粉丝的立场而言，\n她需要Grand Live那样的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38079de2b60b567293781d9e4886b4562cebcd0c43aae5a33d3f8200b45e30da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2487d1045c85a86cf925ce5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8979f23cd731e31020dc4a49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，对粉丝而言，\n“Grand Live”到底是什么？\n我们开始针对这个方面深入探讨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34372f841d7c64e8c0dc2fd51fb8fd4d62e1587d6d09aa3e35f5ab1e57c173c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4676650b5a6421761adf650d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "打造出让你闪耀的舞台",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1421198b6288fa67f2a29b602142d28d85466b14ff7384a2fcccad03146ab9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96de79fdeb8149493aeef457",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当大家在探究Grand Live的意义时，\n一直看着我们至今为止所做的一切的粉丝，\n表明希望能提供协助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b62cd5fb49e17e8b4d5715b80a90edfadc9367831bd9994c543306da5215adf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c7b58d1e32fabe6c53a6ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听完粉丝的意见后，轻柔致意灵光一闪。\n她提议让粉丝在演唱会上自由喊出声音，\n并且请表演者仔细听他们的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3ba4c4f41ba549b6557cd1c31854073f23c142323c58f361dd75e88c70a1194",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68d7e54f3dcdbee1c5ad5990",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成员们于舞台上感受到倾泻而下的“心意”。\n由此可见，粉丝们也有想要传达给她们的心意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d039b1392c89d61dc1679079cd915d6e7e7aef00777a583ee63c06dc3f728eb9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1f02c7b5a7c0144e4894da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "轻柔致意看见眼前的这一幕，而坚信\n“Grand Live”对粉丝们而言也是有必要的，\n因此下定决心复办活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e85fcb2a4269d0ab5f96c4584000097b85ad90fb87957b47a7aed171725e4c92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f74851846a74947aebe0dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "置身在“与你”闪耀的舞台",
      "source_fingerprint": "0540b827c942ab21d0a67ea3dfa0fb0550af593b92a0fb71302c01312b719630",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662278bf6afa5e3fb116311e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b91127052fd4014fc4c14d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "轻柔致意以学园的赛马娘们为对象，\n举行了“Grand Live”的大规模说明会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "109f2e2ff57793887f4dd3b2c5d6f5b86e5a21265748df7c2c2bfe5aa6be35d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62b39b323d45212290e25c07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87fd28943cafb2217ee0ca47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“Grand Live”是大家都能唱歌的演唱会，\n也是所有粉丝都能向自己喜欢的赛马娘\n传达心意的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d19c96742d56e2ab4e06845b3b088c770e6a4972e0bd6b5b35fb0b000fb083b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a5288e7c184194c77f8b8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003409.json",
      "json_path": [
