    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ce590658ed5fc49d73b55a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘与粉丝的心意，\n也就是双方的私心相互碰撞而产生的热情──\n想必能成为拓展自己可能性的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55d3dbdaa7f86d15f13550501476ae4cb710f4baca9cc46928d440709f792a48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
