    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56837ca004282c91d0d7e66e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高达十万人以上规模的盛大表演，\n越来越有希望实现了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "518cc744f7d4b9cf78eab08e7d2f32564a18d1d5f2f48e34917e158eecf700a5",
