      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时，URA来了联络。\n他们终于同意举办Grand Live了！\n为了让演唱会成真，继续进行准备工作吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e9030f3dec9dadc80c5f293f449bac4caaac56df37248a9317215e773eec63",
