    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728419ca0af0bad45d62744c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "轻柔致意为Grand Live准备了一首歌曲，\n然后拜托我们为这首歌填词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6975416070b8f8d924b183730248477845c1a39f6fdce486c896dd00d40164d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d0ac1b4eb3a4389cf558918",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，大家一起动脑思考，\n在当下奔跑的赛马娘，\n要为支持着自己的粉丝们送上什么样的歌词。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c28d3117b00a797c57d0bfb03c5fc0a756c33e623bf03be48db71545276e4487",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c97ae82ccb3ba5a6fc269ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了实现伟大的梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6720f60f8fa50bc13e2de3a9a5261b7c504fa3054ca35248c5cbec03a20276",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003411.json",
      "json_path": [
