      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在过去，轻柔致意的前辈即使非常努力，\n还是无法站上胜者舞台的C位。\n……轻柔致意曾在近处看着那样的前辈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8589f87e5ab6a9114f2d946a6b98cae472258b9f5734b9bd487a2eabf7584fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
