      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天，她也怀抱着过去的回忆，\n继续为演唱会宣传造势。\n不过，有位赛马娘一脸生气地盯着她们看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd843df11bbfcd7e6eff571abc73063deac603423f86b059bdaaa634c666ca15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
