      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，无声铃鹿正在烦恼。\n她还是无法理解爱丽速子所暗示的\n与她的奔跑有关的“演唱会的意义”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40380285482a00ab8cb734d0fab2f59aee7280a531375d75f6caf81bf55e89b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003412.json",
      "json_path": [
