      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，她请我和轻柔致意\n一起为这首歌想歌名。\n要送给赛马娘们什么话呢──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b43a74cf16a6884de3cafd54f07bdb043657735b0b0957e729ae34c0c873048",
