    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eabf608c384ff5b5611c2054",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Grand Live的气氛相当热烈！\n赛马娘和粉丝相互激荡彼此的心意，\n共同度过了一段无可取代的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d971f06193211145b6ec5ee9d63aabe59a9f0a7c26b4bdd66ef9a3865a3b788b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
